      <div class="card-body">
        <span class="portal-legal-kicker">Findoly Solutions LLP</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="portal-legal-lead">How Findoly handles Provider information, account security data, payments, marketplace activity and customer lead information.</p>
        <p class="portal-legal-effective">Effective and last updated: 30 July 2026</p>
        <aside class="portal-legal-callout is-important"><strong>Provider responsibility</strong><p>After you unlock and independently use customer information, you are responsible for using it lawfully, securely and only for the submitted service requirement.</p></aside>
